/ 08) JOE FISCHETTI

/     JOE IS A MEMBER OF THE WCFMPG AND P?S.  JOE IS RESPONSIBLE FOR EXPLAINING
/     PDP-8 CO-ROUTINES TO VARIOUS INDIVIDUALS SUCH AS CHARLES LASNER, CHIEF
