/     THROUGHOUT P?S/8 TO SAVE CODE SPACE AND IMPROVE PERFORMANCE.]

/ 09) RICHARD LARY

/     RICHIE [AKA "MOUTH"] IS A FAMOUS MEMBER OF THE WCFMPG, P?S AND THE FRIENDS
/     OF THE BOSTON MASSACRE.  MOST OF THE WORK MENTIONED IN THIS DOCUMENT IS AN
/     OUTGROWTH OF HIS ORIGINAL EFFORT KNOWN AS THE R-L MONITOR SYSTEM [AKA
/     MS/8], WHICH WAS CREATED IN PARTNERSHIP WITH LENNY ELEKMAN [AND TO A
/     LESSER EXTENT THE OTHER MEMBERS OF THE WCFMPG MENTIONED IN THIS DOCUMENT].
/     THE TWO OF THEM ARE ALSO KNOWN FOR WRITING POLY BASIC [LATER SOLD BY DEC
/     AS EDU-SYSTEM 30] AND THE ORIGINAL PRECURSOR TO POLY SPACEWAR.  MOST OF
/     THE MEMBERS OF THE WCFMPG ARE KNOWN FOR IMPLEMENTATIONS OF THE BASIC
/     LANGUAGE.

/     THE INSPIRATION FOR THE R-L MONITOR IS THE SPECIFIC IMPLEMENTATION OF
/     BASIC ON THE GE-235 TIMESHARING SYSTEM [FROM A USER'S PERSPECTIVE].  THE
/     ACTUAL GE-235 SYSTEM WAS OFTEN HACKED BY THE WCFMPG; SOME OF ITS MEMBERS
/     WERE EVEN PAID TO REVEAL SHORTCOMINGS OF THAT SYSTEM.

/     RICHIE ALSO WROTE THE ORIGINAL CRUDE HACK VERSION OF PS/8 OVER A WEEKEND.
/     HE ALSO PARTICIPATED IN VARIOUS ASPECTS OF ITS EVENTUAL UPGRADE; HOWEVER,
/     IT ALSO HAD MANY SERIOUS DOWNTURNS AS EVENTUALLY OS/8 WAS PERVERTED BY THE
/     ACTIVE PARTICIPATION OF SEMI-COMPETENT PROGRAMMERS.  DUE TO MANAGEMENT
/     INTERFERENCE, THE TENTATIVE CODING WAS NEVER SCRUTINIZED AND THUS BECAME
/     PERMANENT PREMATURELY FORCING VARIOUS SERIOUS DESIGN BUGS TO BECOME
/     UNFIXABLE.  ALL MEMBERS OF THE P?S ARE FAMILIAR WITH HOW TO USE THIS
/     FAMILY OF PRODUCT; SOME EVEN GOT PAID TO CREATE CERTAIN PORTIONS OF IT.
/     STILL OTHERS CRITICIZED IT AND INSTEAD PARTICIPATED IN THE CREATION OF
/     P?S/8 WHICH HAS A DESIGN BASE THAT CAN OUTPERFORM AND TOTALLY OBSOLETE
/     OS/8 WHEN SUFFICIENT CODE IS WRITTEN.
/     RICHIE WAS ALSO LEAD PROGRAMMER FOR THE DEC STORAGE DIVISION IN COLORADO
/     FOR MANY YEARS; HE PERSONALLY HOLDS MANY STORAGE TECHNOLOGY PATENTS
/     RELATING TO SMART ADAPTATION OF HOST OPERATING SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS TO
/     MAXIMIZE THE PERFORMANCE OF RELATIVELY MEDIOCRE DISK STORAGE WITHIN THE
/     IMBEDDED CONTROLLER.

/     IT IS ARGUABLE THAT RICHIE'S WORK MADE SO MANY MILLIONS OF DOLLARS FOR DEC
/     THAT WITHOUT HIS EFFORTS, THE COMPANY WOULD HAVE GONE OUT OF BUSINESS
/     YEARS BEFORE BAD MANAGEMENT CAUSED THE EVENTUAL COMPANY DEMISE.

/ 10) CHARLES LASNER

/     CHARLES IS A MEMBER OF THE P?S.  HE IS THE CHIEF ARCHITECT OF P?S/8 AND
/     AUTHOR OF KERMIT-12 FOR OS/8 INCLUDING ALL OF THE ASSOCIATED UTILITIES.
/     CHARLES ALSO WROTE THE OPERATING SYSTEM INTERFACE TO FOCAL, 1969 FOR BOTH
/     THE R-L MONITOR AND P?S/8.

/     CHARLES ALSO CREATED THE RELOADER CONCEPT FOR RICHARD LARY'S "SLURP"
/     LOADER WHICH CAN BEST BE DESCRIBED AS A "BENEFICIAL COMPUTER VIRUS", AS
/     WELL AS ALL OF THE AUXILIARY MODES OF THE P?S/8 BIN PROGRAM INCLUDING THE
/     SQUEEZED-DOWN VERSION OF THE PAPER-TAPE BIN LOADER.  MOST OF THE HANDLERS
/     THROUGHOUT P?S/8 FOR ALL SUPPORTED DEVICES WERE WRITTEN BY HIM AS WELL AS
/     HUNDREDS OF OPTIMIZATION TRICKS THROUGHOUT P?S/8 BASED ON PRINCIPLES
/     DISCUSSED IN THIS DOCUMENT.

/     CHARLES HAS TAKEN TOTAL RESPONSIBILITY FOR ALL COMPONENTS OF P?S/8 SINCE
/     THE CREATION OF HIS VARIOUS BUSINESS ENTITIES STATED ELSEWHERE IN THIS
/     DOCUMENT.  SOME COMPONENTS OF P?S/8 WERE WRITTEN BY VARIOUS INDIVIDUALS
/     NOT STATED HERE DUE TO THEIR REQUEST FOR ANONYMITY.  SOME OF THESE PEOPLE
/     ARE KNOWN FOR THEIR EFFORTS NOT NECESSARILY MAKING ANY POSITIVE
/     CONTRIBUTION TO THE OVERALL PROJECT.  IN ALL RELEVANT CASES, ALL CODE HAS
/     GENERALLY BEEN REWRITTEN AND NOW KNOWN TO BE FUNCTIONAL.  FOR THOSE WHO
/     CONSIDER THEIR WORK OF POSITIVE WORTH, THEY ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT
/     CHARLES LASNER IF THEY WISH TO BE IDENTIFIED; IT IS BELIEVED THE STATUTE
/     OF LIMITATIONS NOW APPLIES IN ALL CASES.  CHARLES WILL DENY ANY KNOWLEDGE
/     OF WITNESS PROTECTION OR OTHER APPLICABLE PROGRAMS. 

